WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
Welcome to Next Play. I’m Brian Kennedy Jr.

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:06.240
Your goal is a process-goal and reflection log.

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:09.600
Choose one observable action within your control and

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:11.920
a short cue to practice. Keep your work

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:14.293
private, record what you tried, and set a

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:17.520
review date. This workbook is not mental-health treatment

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:19.360
or a promise of performance gains.
